# Kept out of what the browser-node image's build is sent: the history, virtualenvs, the host's node_modules (the
# image runs npm ci itself), bytecode, data and .env files. The image copies package.json, package-lock.json,
# policies/, entrypoint.sh, server.mjs, sandbox.mjs, sandbox-report.mjs and novnc_origin.py.
.git
**/.venv*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
data
**/.env*
